{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":62798,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2011,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tjs9U3k7xjKD4U6RmJxlPvIBGbc.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1067832","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A nightclub is used by vampires to trap unsuspecting guests and feed on them. Just as the feast is about to start, Blade arrives looking for the ancient vampire who long ago infected his mother - Deacon Frost. However, he gets company.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/epQKZX6sHbxzzdgKcvfHBJ30JXL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/epQKZX6sHbxzzdgKcvfHBJ30JXL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1067833","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sakomizu, a middle-aged police detective in Osaka, is troubled by a recent series of missing Southeast Asian women. After he meets up with Blade, they discover that the chief of police is helping to provide local vampires with human blood.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sCDbXM7HaIW30eGfOQk3BEPhsdM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sCDbXM7HaIW30eGfOQk3BEPhsdM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1067834","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Aboard a cargo ship heading for the Philippines, Blade departs Kobe Harbor hot on Deacon Frost's trail. Makoto, a young human female vampire hunter, is also on the ship. She seeks vengeance and her target is - Blade.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/icNJTdrN5GgTOHOoggpLDRkCQ5l.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/icNJTdrN5GgTOHOoggpLDRkCQ5l.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1067835","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Determined to rescue his mentor, Van Hesling, from the clutches of a pack of Mandurago vampires, Blade tracks him to a local slum in the Philippines. He also remembers his difficult childhood and the time he met his undead mother.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wYz8BbkUMo8YOf79JuXhhXsM1Jm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wYz8BbkUMo8YOf79JuXhhXsM1Jm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1067836","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Siquijor Island, the location of an Existence research facility, is home to the Berdugo tribe who have used white magic to keep vampires under control since ancient times. Against the wishes of the Berdugo, Blade and Makoto set out in search for Frost's facility.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jUmA0fHXwXdRplZ5Q9Ggg1WJeyq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jUmA0fHXwXdRplZ5Q9Ggg1WJeyq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1067837","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A small village in Sumatra has been taken over by Frost's people. The men are forced to work in his silver mine, while all the women have been turned into vampires. The local medicine man believes he can cure them, but Blade doubts that.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kgwFMnJlPh3ts1HWwDC1ROeybUv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kgwFMnJlPh3ts1HWwDC1ROeybUv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1067838","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Blade and Makoto arrive in the lawless island city of Madripoor, where the weapons factory that Frost's men use to melt silver is located, and are instantly attacked by them. That's when Blade's old friend shows up - Wolverine.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rGY6EcPUUnyJZLUppyI4oIyX7ve.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rGY6EcPUUnyJZLUppyI4oIyX7ve.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1067839","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the jungles of Vietnam, Blade is attacked by a band of vampire ninjas led by Kikyo Mikage, an amoral master samurai with mutant powers similar to Wolverine's. G.I. Stan Davis, a victim of secret US weapons program, helps Blade.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tpYVfOCPfa6epLsAPKPJe70TRcK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tpYVfOCPfa6epLsAPKPJe70TRcK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1067840","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Blade has no choice but to fight the mutant assassin, Kikyo Mikage. While fighting, they remember the time when they were studying sword fighting together under the same master. However, their old master suddenly appears - now a vampire.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8WiwHf8rhqnqkyYfCTtYy8ZY1o.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n8WiwHf8rhqnqkyYfCTtYy8ZY1o.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1067841","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Captured Blade is taken to the Existence research lab known as 'The Factory', in Cambodia, to be experimented on by Deacon Frost who divulges his own tragic personal history, twisted motives and awful ambitions. Makoto finds them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/imfF6haz9umiPlqd2FCqWhlWIir.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/imfF6haz9umiPlqd2FCqWhlWIir.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1067842","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While in captivity and pushed to his limits, Blade struggles to regain control of himself as his allies attempt a daring rescue. Ironically, this gets Frost closer to his goal and Blade loses a friend. The vampire council is next.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/30kaUrULjADgjRqPJuDgRJTAJ4o.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/30kaUrULjADgjRqPJuDgRJTAJ4o.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1067843","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Blade invades Amaurot, the City of Vampires and headquarters of Existence, while cutting his way through anything that stands between him and now evolved Deacon Frost. Frost's monstrosities fight back, but Blade gets surprise help.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v1LzFeFAEcwpambrOpTNXzNuxRf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v1LzFeFAEcwpambrOpTNXzNuxRf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62798/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793373187527,"status":"ok"}}}
